{"body":{"kept":"Whole in the author's words: all twenty-seven of their utterances, each as it came, the typed ones with their slips; a word the dictation misheard is corrected on the word, with what it wrote kept. Whether each came spoken or typed is the session's own reading. The session's answers were not kept: what they did stands in b77ce18, the small resolved; d84b63f, levels, the root as what is attached, the glue carved and the wiki rewritten; and 689b350, a kernel for functions prototyped and grounded in nineteen real cases; and in the store's own commits. OpenLight's specs were read anew from a clone of github.com/Cwejman/OpenLight, its expressions, planner, threads and scenes, and the talks of Rich Hickey it gathered. Measured on the real stores: a store's level took 273 ms through the kernel as written and 1.3 ms over the field laid out as arrays.","on":"2026-11-09 to 2026-11-10","paths":[{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1WK"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1WM"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1WN"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1WP"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1WQ"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1WR"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1WS"}],"said":[{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X02C"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X02N"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X032"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X03V"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X05M"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X0VZ"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X0XD"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X0ZR"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X0ZY"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X115"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X11Q"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X12W"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X16G"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X18R"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1A7"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1CF"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1DE"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1EB"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1F9"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1GP"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1H3"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1K5"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1NY"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1Q1"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1QS"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1VC"},{"$ref":"1M72R7PH0H0X1WJ"}],"voice":{"$ref":"1M6ZTFHV87PK001"}},"id":"1M6ZTFHV87PK000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000000"],"name":"A seventh session, kept whole: the field seen by its levels,